# ---- DECRQPSR (cursor information, tab stops), DECRSPS, DECRQTSR, DECRSTS, DECRQDE and the locator

test DECRQPSR 1 reports the cursor information
spec VT510 DECCIR: Pr;Pc;Pp;Srend;Satt;Sflag;Pgl;Pgr;Scss;Sdesig, the example of a fresh terminal 1;1;1;@;@;@;0;2;@;BB%5%5 with ASCII in all four sets
known-fail: alacritty – no DECRQPSR or DECRSPS: they are ignored
size 10 4
feed \e[1$w
reply \eP1$u1;1;1;@;@;@;0;2;@;BBBB\e\\

test DECCIR reports the position, the rendition and the protection
spec VT510 DECCIR: Srend bit 1 bold and 2 underline (bold and underline is C), Satt bit 1 DECSCA (A)
known-fail: alacritty – no DECRQPSR or DECRSPS: they are ignored
size 10 4
feed \e[1;4m\e[1"q\e[3;5H\e[1$w
reply \eP1$u3;5;1;C;A;@;0;2;@;BBBB\e\\

test DECCIR reports origin mode, a pending wrap and a single shift
