reply \eP1$u1;10;1;@;@;M;0;2;@;BBBB\e\\

test DECCIR reports the character sets, their sizes and what is invoked
spec VT510 DECCIR: Pgl and Pgr the sets in GL and GR, Scss one bit per set for 96 characters (G2 bit 3, G3 bit 4), Sdesig the final characters; SS2 is Sflag bit 2
known-fail: alacritty – no DECRQPSR or DECRSPS: they are ignored
